<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy Birthday Kowsalya ❤️</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;
}

body{

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff758c,#ff7eb3,#ffc371);

overflow-x:hidden;

color:white;

text-align:center;

}

.hero{

height:100vh;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

flex-direction:column;

padding:20px;

}

.hero img{

width:280px;

height:280px;

border-radius:50%;

object-fit:cover;

border:8px solid white;

box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.5);

}

h1{

font-size:55px;

margin-top:20px;

animation:glow 2s infinite alternate;

}

h2{

margin-top:10px;

font-size:32px;

}

p{

font-size:20px;

margin-top:20px;

line-height:1.8;

max-width:850px;

}

button{

margin-top:35px;

padding:15px 35px;

border:none;

border-radius:40px;

font-size:20px;

cursor:pointer;

background:white;

color:#ff4081;

font-weight:bold;

transition:.3s;

}

button:hover{

transform:scale(1.1);

}

.gallery{

padding:80px 20px;

}

.photos{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));

gap:20px;

max-width:1000px;

margin:auto;

margin-top:40px;

}

.photos img{

width:100%;

border-radius:20px;

border:5px solid white;

}

footer{

padding:40px;

font-size:20px;

}

@keyframes glow{

from{

text-shadow:0 0 10px white;

}

to{

text-shadow:0 0 40px yellow;

}

}

.heart{

position:fixed;

bottom:-20px;

font-size:30px;

animation:float 8s linear infinite;

}

@keyframes float{

0%{

transform:translateY(0);

opacity:1;

}

100%{

transform:translateY(-110vh);

opacity:0;

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">

<img src="photo1.jpg">

<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday 🎂</h1>

<h2>Kowsalya ❤️</h2>

<p>

A friend is a friend, but a best friend is even better.

Happy Birthday to the best friend anyone could ask for.

May your life always be filled with happiness,

good health,

love,

success,

and beautiful memories.

</p>

<button onclick="surprise()">

🎁 Click Here

</button>

<h2 id="msg"></h2>

</div>

<div class="gallery">

<h1>📸 Our Beautiful Memories ❤️</h1>

<div class="photos">

<img src="photo1.jpg">

<img src="photo2.jpg">

</div>

</div>

<footer>

💖

Dear Kowsalya,

Thank you for being such a wonderful friend.

Every memory with you is special.

May this birthday bring you endless joy,

success,

peace,

and happiness.

Keep smiling forever.

❤️

<br><br>

With Best Wishes,

<b>Hemanth</b>

<br><br>

🎂 Birthday : 29 September 2003

</footer>

<script>

function surprise(){

document.getElementById("msg").innerHTML=

"🎉 Happy Birthday Kowsalya ❤️<br>You are the best friend anyone could ask for. May all your dreams come true! 🎂✨";

}

function heart(){

const h=document.createElement("div");

h.innerHTML="💖";

h.className="heart";

h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

h.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*30)+"px";

document.body.appendChild(h);

setTimeout(()=>{

h.remove();

},8000);

}

setInterval(heart,300);

</script>

</body>

</html>
